### =====================================================================
### PUMAIA BACKEND - PRUEBAS DE CONSENTIMIENTOS Y AVISOS DE PRIVACIDAD
### Modelos: PrivacyNotice, ConsentRecord (Append-only)
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@accessToken = {{loginDevStudent.response.body.accessToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. CONSULTAR AVISOS DE PRIVACIDAD VIGENTES (PÚBLICO)
### Retorna el texto y la versión activa de TERMS_AND_NOTICE, ANALYTICS e IMPROVEMENT
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consents/notices

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. CONSULTAR ESTADO DE CONSENTIMIENTOS DEL USUARIO AUTENTICADO
### Retorna si el usuario tiene aceptada la versión vigente o requiere actualización
### Requiere JWT
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consents/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CONSULTAR HISTORIAL INMUTABLE DE CONSENTIMIENTOS DEL USUARIO
### Retorna todas las filas de ConsentRecord históricas
### Requiere JWT
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consents/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. REGISTRAR CONSENTIMIENTO INDIVIDUAL (APPEND-ONLY)
### Tipos: TERMS_AND_NOTICE, ANALYTICS, IMPROVEMENT
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consents
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "TERMS_AND_NOTICE",
  "noticeId": "UUID_DEL_AVISO_VIGENTE",
  "granted": true
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. REGISTRAR CONSENTIMIENTOS EN LOTE (ONBOARDING)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consents/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "consents": [
    {
      "kind": "TERMS_AND_NOTICE",
      "noticeId": "UUID_DEL_AVISO_TERMS",
      "granted": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "ANALYTICS",
      "noticeId": "UUID_DEL_AVISO_ANALYTICS",
      "granted": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "IMPROVEMENT",
      "noticeId": "UUID_DEL_AVISO_IMPROVEMENT",
      "granted": false
    }
  ]
}

